      "id": "claim_84e2484175984a17b9aefd50ca3fdab6",
      "statement": "The Path 1 harness is intentionally distinct from AgentCore's native `ThirdParty.DeepEval.*` evaluators: the README says those AWS-native evaluators run against deployed-runtime sessions, while this harness uses the pip `deepeval` package and custom metrics.",
